  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-term technical assistance to the Enhancing Participatory Democracy in Namibia (EPDN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the contract is to; i) strengthen the capacities of both Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) and Parliament and; ii) to increase collaboration and coordination between Civil Society Organisations, Government and Parliament in the implementation and monitoring of public policies and programmes</narrative>
